Z||000004||Denny||08-31-2001||08:09 PM||||Anyone looking for this information (pegging temperature gauge fix), Oliver doesn't have it on his site, but he does mention that it's "on the Internet." I just happened to find a copy I printed, with diagrams, available from <A HREF="http://www.michiganfieroclub.org/." TARGET=_blank>http://www.michiganfieroclub.org/</A>.  Scroll down, the link is next to the Fiero nose badge.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 08-31-2001).]||||reg||10
